WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 14]

01:50.380 --> 01:51.820
- I'll kill you! - I'll kill you!

01:52.740 --> 01:53.540
I'll kill you!

01:53.740 --> 01:54.700
Die!

01:58.260 --> 01:59.620
You deserve to die!

02:06.580 --> 02:07.620
Die!

02:10.340 --> 02:11.420
Drop dead!

02:12.860 --> 02:14.100
You took General Chu's life!

02:14.100 --> 02:15.180
Die!

02:21.060 --> 02:22.060
I'll kill you!

02:22.260 --> 02:23.500
You treacherous parasite!

03:16.180 --> 03:17.740
You ferocious little thing.

03:18.100 --> 03:19.380
You've got a vicious bite.

03:19.860 --> 03:20.940
I hurt your men.

03:21.860 --> 03:22.900
Just go ahead and kill me.

03:24.300 --> 03:25.380
You wish to die?

03:38.180 --> 03:39.340
Do you know why?

03:40.260 --> 03:41.580
Because deep down,

03:41.940 --> 03:43.100
you still cling to life.

03:55.700 --> 03:56.860
Since you're not going to die today,

03:57.340 --> 03:58.340
you're coming with me.

04:03.260 --> 04:04.260
Kill him!

04:09.900 --> 04:10.580
Give way!

04:11.140 --> 04:11.780
Stand clear!

04:12.540 --> 04:13.180
Move aside!

04:13.300 --> 04:15.060
- Clear out, all of you! - Make way!

04:15.860 --> 04:17.060
Whatever Xie Yanlai's crimes may be,

04:17.580 --> 04:18.860
he will face a military tribunal.

04:19.220 --> 04:21.020
None of you may take justice into your own hands!

04:25.860 --> 04:27.260
On your feet.

04:29.340 --> 04:30.820
At that time,

04:31.140 --> 04:32.420
we knew that medicine

04:32.420 --> 04:33.860
was meant to save the General.

04:34.180 --> 04:34.940
Nobody could have foreseen

04:34.940 --> 04:36.420
that it would end up like this.

04:36.780 --> 04:37.980
The court even honored your service

04:38.300 --> 04:40.100
and rewarded you for the Northern Desert campaign.

04:40.340 --> 04:41.460
Why are you groveling?

04:41.500 --> 04:42.940
Who are you trying to atone to?

04:44.060 --> 04:44.820
Honored?

04:49.740 --> 04:51.260
That honor was bought with the General's life.

04:51.580 --> 04:52.580
We had

04:52.580 --> 04:54.100
no better choice back then.

04:56.940 --> 04:58.660
You...

05:08.060 --> 05:09.540
Wrong is wrong.

05:10.420 --> 05:11.420
There is no excuse for it.

05:31.500 --> 05:35.580
♪Light shatters into silhouettes♪

05:36.140 --> 05:42.020
♪A lingering mark on my palm♪

05:42.500 --> 05:47.300
♪Hooves thunder through the ashes of war♪

05:48.060 --> 05:51.260
♪Riding the wild wind straight into the dawn♪

05:51.260 --> 05:52.100
Since when does Yunzhong Prefecture

05:52.780 --> 05:54.100
allow vigilante justice?

05:55.140 --> 05:57.820
♪A vivid life♪

05:58.260 --> 06:00.420
♪Bathed in tears♪

06:00.580 --> 06:04.260
♪Surging toward the dawn♪

06:04.740 --> 06:09.380
♪Let it burn until there's nothing left♪

06:09.940 --> 06:12.580
♪We crown our pain like glory♪

06:12.980 --> 06:16.100
♪Give that long-held wish a chance♪

06:16.340 --> 06:21.020
♪Let's run straight into the ruins♪

06:21.300 --> 06:24.020
♪I'd spend the rest of my life with you♪

06:24.340 --> 06:27.020
♪Even if longing turns to ash♪

06:27.260 --> 06:28.820
♪And forms a timeless monument♪

06:28.820 --> 06:29.620
Your Highness, please discern the truth!

06:29.900 --> 06:31.380
General Chu died a senseless death,

06:31.500 --> 06:33.100
and we cannot stomach

06:33.100 --> 06:34.380
this injustice!

06:34.740 --> 06:35.820
He's a monster in human skin!

06:36.060 --> 06:37.820
If he is innocent of General Chu's murder,

06:38.060 --> 06:39.460
why submit to punishment so readily?

06:39.860 --> 06:40.940
Did any of you actually witness

06:40.940 --> 06:41.740
him commit the murder?

06:49.540 --> 06:50.300
Xie Yanlai.

06:51.820 --> 06:53.300
Before the people of Yunzhong Prefecture,

06:54.140 --> 06:55.500
I will ask you one last time.

06:57.500 --> 06:58.700
Did you truly intend

07:00.460 --> 07:01.780
to harm my father?

07:09.660 --> 07:10.220
Your Highness,

07:10.500 --> 07:11.780
you mustn't believe a word he says.

07:11.900 --> 07:13.140
He's of the Xie Family!

07:16.540 --> 07:18.220
He entered my father's service at sixteen.

07:19.380 --> 07:20.980
Xie Yanlai is first a soldier of the Chu Army,

07:21.500 --> 07:22.780
only then, a member of the Xie Family.

07:25.100 --> 07:26.500
If you wonder

07:27.020 --> 07:28.300
how my father died,

07:30.500 --> 07:32.020
I shall lay bare the truth now.

07:33.100 --> 07:33.540
Army Physician!

07:34.900 --> 07:36.380
The poison that struck the General

07:36.820 --> 07:38.540
is known as the Bloodburn Pill,

07:38.820 --> 07:41.100
refined from several lethal toxins.

07:41.900 --> 07:43.740
In a short span,

07:44.060 --> 07:46.180
it forces the blood to race

07:46.500 --> 07:48.500
and causes a violent surge of physical strength.

07:48.860 --> 07:50.740
It can even grant a dying man

07:50.860 --> 07:52.020
a final, fleeting burst of vitality.

07:52.820 --> 07:53.620
Three years ago,

07:54.060 --> 07:55.060
at the Battle of the Frontier River,

07:55.500 --> 07:57.020
General Chu was struck by a poisoned arrow.

07:57.900 --> 07:59.460
The Army Physician was entirely helpless.

07:59.940 --> 08:01.340
I watched as the General

08:01.420 --> 08:02.420
coughed up blood relentlessly.

08:02.700 --> 08:04.380
It was Jiu's pill

08:04.660 --> 08:05.900
that dragged the General back

08:06.020 --> 08:08.020
from the very brink of death.

08:08.700 --> 08:09.940
We believed that medicine

08:10.060 --> 08:11.300
was his last hope.

08:11.780 --> 08:12.940
But who could have guessed

08:13.540 --> 08:15.180
it would only defer the General's demise at a terrible cost?

08:15.820 --> 08:17.660
Yet, if we hadn't used it that day,

08:18.420 --> 08:19.060
the General

08:19.540 --> 08:22.940
would have perished on the spot.

08:25.700 --> 08:27.180
Did we truly misjudge him?

08:29.620 --> 08:30.620
In the fourteenth year of Tianshu,

08:31.700 --> 08:33.020
Jiu first joined Yunzhong Prefecture.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.580
While on patrol,

08:36.740 --> 08:38.740
he discovered a Northern Desert scout infiltrating our frontier.

08:39.580 --> 08:40.300
Though only a boy

08:40.300 --> 08:41.380
of sixteen,

08:42.100 --> 08:43.620
he fought them off at all costs,

08:43.940 --> 08:45.060
sustaining multiple stab wounds,

08:45.620 --> 08:46.860
one just half a cun from his heart.

08:47.860 --> 08:48.900
In the fifteenth year of Tianshu,

08:50.140 --> 08:53.100
when the Northern Desert troops raided a frontier village,

08:55.980 --> 08:57.220
General Chu led the counterattack.

08:58.180 --> 08:59.260
Jiu took a spear strike

09:00.700 --> 09:01.940
meant for the General on his shoulders,

09:02.740 --> 09:04.340
shielding the entire village.

09:05.620 --> 09:06.660
In the sixteenth year of Tianshu,

09:06.820 --> 09:07.700
when the enemy struck again,

09:08.300 --> 09:10.060
he defended the frontier river with the General.

09:10.740 --> 09:12.060
He took two hits

09:12.060 --> 09:13.140
amidst a hail of arrows,

09:13.660 --> 09:14.780
but managed to chop down the drawbridge,

09:15.020 --> 09:15.940
halting

09:15.940 --> 09:16.940
the enemy's advance

09:17.700 --> 09:18.900
and sparing the State of Chu

09:19.620 --> 09:20.540
from total devastation.

09:21.420 --> 09:22.940
And during the recent battle of Wangcheng,

09:23.700 --> 09:24.700
he infiltrated the enemy camp alone

09:25.660 --> 09:27.140
to sabotage their provisions and water supplies,

09:27.700 --> 09:29.180
nearly losing his life in the fray.

09:30.940 --> 09:31.780
Would a man like this

09:33.020 --> 09:33.860
truly harm

09:33.860 --> 09:35.060
his own commander?

09:35.980 --> 09:37.860
Every scar on Jiu's body was earned

09:38.020 --> 09:39.780
while shielding you all.

09:40.420 --> 09:41.820
If you want to take his life,

09:42.260 --> 09:43.220
look at those wounds

09:43.660 --> 09:44.660
and ask yourselves

09:44.660 --> 09:45.980
if your consciences can bear it.

09:48.540 --> 09:49.100
Are we to kill a man

09:49.100 --> 09:50.460
who saved General Chu,

09:51.300 --> 09:52.820
Yunzhong Prefecture,

09:53.500 --> 09:54.380
and the State of Chu,

09:55.100 --> 09:56.700
just on a rumor?

09:57.580 --> 09:58.220
Back then,

09:59.300 --> 10:00.860
Fu Jiu snuck into a Northern Desert camp

10:01.540 --> 10:03.220
to save us

10:03.740 --> 10:04.660
and took the branding for us

10:05.420 --> 10:07.100
when he was discovered.

10:07.540 --> 10:08.620
Back at the frontier river,

10:09.180 --> 10:10.300
I was about to be crushed

10:10.300 --> 10:11.540
under the enemy cavalry.

10:12.140 --> 10:13.540
It was Fu Jiu who dragged me back.

10:13.860 --> 10:14.620
I saw him

10:14.940 --> 10:16.140
risk his life for the General.

10:16.500 --> 10:17.300
I refuse to believe

10:17.940 --> 10:19.380
a man like that could turn traitor.

10:19.860 --> 10:20.860
Look

10:21.380 --> 10:22.940
at all his scars.

10:23.460 --> 10:25.060
Fighting the Northern Desert troops

10:25.900 --> 10:28.500
must have been a constant dance with death.

11:26.260 --> 11:26.980
Thank you.

11:27.780 --> 11:28.540
I was just telling...

11:30.140 --> 11:31.460
the people what really happened.

11:32.780 --> 11:34.140
This incident did not happen by chance.

11:35.140 --> 11:36.780
Someone must be pulling the strings.

11:38.420 --> 11:39.460
It is all my fault.

11:42.540 --> 11:44.220
If he hadn't taken the medicine I provided...

11:45.900 --> 11:46.500
Zhao.

11:47.580 --> 11:48.660
I know you hate me.

11:50.020 --> 11:51.220
You have every right to.

11:52.820 --> 11:53.940
I did hate you once.

11:55.580 --> 11:56.460
But I realize

11:58.340 --> 11:59.580
that you were merely a convenient outlet

11:59.580 --> 12:01.140
for my grief and fury.

12:02.260 --> 12:03.740
I felt so utterly powerless,

12:04.900 --> 12:06.220
with no one to hold accountable

12:07.540 --> 12:08.900
or to blame.

12:09.900 --> 12:10.580
After all,

12:12.420 --> 12:14.300
this was my father's choice.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.420
He chose to die

12:16.420 --> 12:18.220
on the battlefield as a commander,

12:19.700 --> 12:20.900
claiming one final victory

12:20.900 --> 12:22.500
over his lifelong nemesis, the Northern Desert King.

12:24.300 --> 12:25.340
And I was there,

12:26.820 --> 12:28.220
fighting right alongside him.

12:29.420 --> 12:30.780
He lived his final moments

12:31.980 --> 12:33.380
to the fullest,

12:34.380 --> 12:35.460
with no regrets.

12:40.780 --> 12:42.420
I have no right to blame you.

12:44.500 --> 12:45.140
If anything...

12:48.620 --> 12:49.980
I ought to thank you.

13:00.500 --> 13:01.700
The General dictated this,

13:02.740 --> 13:03.660
ordered me to record it

13:04.540 --> 13:05.500
and bring it to you.

13:20.980 --> 13:21.780
Zhao,

13:22.700 --> 13:24.140
to read these words is to meet again.

13:25.420 --> 13:27.340
Last night, I saw you in my dreams.

13:28.060 --> 13:29.260
You were still that young girl,

13:29.420 --> 13:31.340
spurring your horse away from home.

13:32.260 --> 13:33.940
I reached out to hold you back,

13:34.780 --> 13:38.420
but my hand caught nothing but drifting sand.

13:39.420 --> 13:42.060
Only now do I realize

13:42.140 --> 13:43.420
that nineteen years on the battlefield

13:44.300 --> 13:45.540
have long stripped me

13:47.140 --> 13:48.780
of the right to be your father.

13:50.580 --> 13:52.460
That year, you asked me in tears

13:53.580 --> 13:57.340
why I kept you confined to the desolate desert.

13:58.380 --> 14:01.700
I mistook it for youthful rebellion.

14:02.380 --> 14:04.260
I never understood that what you yearned for

14:05.340 --> 14:07.380
was never the Capital's splendor,

14:08.620 --> 14:12.420
but merely a light left burning beneath the eaves

14:13.820 --> 14:15.060
to welcome you home.

14:16.580 --> 14:21.020
I've heard that the noble ladies of the Capital are prideful and harsh.

14:22.060 --> 14:23.860
I cannot bear to think how much scorn

14:25.020 --> 14:27.500
you've endured among them.

14:28.420 --> 14:29.940
Every time the thought crosses my mind,

14:31.380 --> 14:33.140
it tears at my very soul.

14:34.540 --> 14:36.300
For nineteen years,

14:37.420 --> 14:39.740
I was not there to guide your early steps,

14:41.100 --> 14:44.580
nor to instruct you in the classics.

14:45.940 --> 14:46.820
I am consumed

14:48.020 --> 14:48.940
by remorse.

14:50.060 --> 14:51.380
If life could start again,

14:52.500 --> 14:55.980
you would not be called the daughter of a hero,

14:57.260 --> 14:59.180
but of Chu Ling, of mine.

15:00.300 --> 15:01.060
Might that be enough?

15:09.220 --> 15:09.740
General.

15:10.580 --> 15:11.260
I'll fetch the Army Physician.

15:11.700 --> 15:12.620
Finish it.

15:15.940 --> 15:16.740
I have spent

15:18.460 --> 15:19.740
half my life in the saddle.

15:21.700 --> 15:22.940
I've failed none

15:25.060 --> 15:26.500
but my wife and daughter.

15:27.940 --> 15:30.260
Now, I ask for nothing

15:31.500 --> 15:32.260
but your forgiveness.

15:33.540 --> 15:36.580
Though tomorrow I may fall on the battlefield,

15:37.420 --> 15:39.380
I shall embrace death with a smile.

15:40.780 --> 15:41.580
Zhao,

15:43.220 --> 15:45.100
water flows forward, never to return.

15:46.260 --> 15:47.500
Do not look back.

15:50.100 --> 15:51.460
Keep moving forward.

15:53.340 --> 15:55.860
From your father, Chu Ling,

15:56.540 --> 15:57.740
in his final hour.

16:03.260 --> 16:03.740
Stop.

16:13.700 --> 16:14.460
Jiu.

16:17.660 --> 16:19.060
Why didn't he tell me

16:19.500 --> 16:21.260
these things sooner?

16:23.700 --> 16:25.220
If he had just spoken up earlier,

16:26.260 --> 16:27.060
I might have had time

16:27.060 --> 16:28.340
to make amends.

16:29.740 --> 16:30.820
And my mother.

16:32.140 --> 16:34.060
She will never hear

16:35.820 --> 16:37.460
what I longed to tell her.

16:40.420 --> 16:41.060
I know.

16:43.460 --> 16:44.180
I understand.

16:44.700 --> 16:46.060
The last words

16:47.460 --> 16:49.180
of my father

16:50.940 --> 16:52.820
were that war is too cruel.

16:55.100 --> 16:57.060
He asked when it would finally end.

16:59.140 --> 17:00.140
My father gave his life

17:00.140 --> 17:01.900
for this victory.

17:03.500 --> 17:05.500
But if the flames of war are never quenched,

17:07.180 --> 17:09.180
what meaning did their sacrifice have?

17:20.060 --> 17:20.940
I will ensure

17:23.220 --> 17:24.420
the State of Chu

17:25.540 --> 17:26.260
never again

17:26.260 --> 17:27.980
paves the road to peace with blood.

17:30.700 --> 17:31.140
I will make sure

17:31.140 --> 17:32.580
the children of this land

17:34.460 --> 17:35.940
never lose their parents

17:37.100 --> 17:38.180
to the scourge of war.

18:10.500 --> 18:12.420
Playing the saint again, are you?

18:13.140 --> 18:14.900
You claim you can shield an entire city,

18:15.100 --> 18:16.140
but can you even protect yourself?

18:16.980 --> 18:18.660
What good is a second chance at life?

18:19.660 --> 18:20.820
You still had to

18:20.820 --> 18:22.380
watch your father die

18:22.780 --> 18:24.460
and your mother meet her bitter end.

18:25.860 --> 18:27.060
But neither of them

18:29.380 --> 18:31.260
regretted the choices they made.

18:31.540 --> 18:32.740
Self-delusion, nothing more.

18:33.420 --> 18:34.300
Lest you forget,

18:34.300 --> 18:35.020
your enemies

18:35.020 --> 18:36.580
remain untouched.

18:37.540 --> 18:38.940
Not just Xiao Xun,

18:39.900 --> 18:42.020
but the Northern Desert that destroyed your parents.

18:43.180 --> 18:44.220
If I were you,

18:44.540 --> 18:46.340
I would march the army against the Northern Desert now

18:46.580 --> 18:48.180
and drown them in a reckoning of blood.

18:49.220 --> 18:49.740
No.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.700
The frontier troops have bled far too much.

18:54.780 --> 18:55.660
And what of it?

18:56.020 --> 18:57.700
Glory is built upon bones.

18:57.700 --> 18:59.140
War demands sacrifice.

18:59.580 --> 19:01.860
Their blood means nothing to you.

19:02.500 --> 19:03.940
The army is yours to wield.

19:04.780 --> 19:05.780
Speak the word,

19:06.260 --> 19:07.740
and they shall obey,

19:07.740 --> 19:09.180
and bleed for your cause.

19:10.260 --> 19:11.500
Don't you want

19:12.220 --> 19:14.540
to avenge your parents upon the Northern Desert King?

19:16.420 --> 19:17.860
Mercy is weakness.

19:18.940 --> 19:21.260
Only slaughter endures.

19:36.780 --> 19:37.580
The pond

19:38.620 --> 19:39.300
needs cleaning.

19:44.700 --> 19:45.820
What a plump chicken.

19:49.260 --> 19:50.140
Look at this one.

19:50.380 --> 19:51.580
Give it to me.

19:53.380 --> 19:54.020
Miss Chu.

19:54.620 --> 19:55.380
Miss Chu.

19:55.580 --> 19:56.340
Miss Chu.

19:56.340 --> 19:57.100
It's rare

19:57.100 --> 19:58.020
to see you out so early.

19:58.340 --> 19:59.100
What are you looking for?

19:59.180 --> 20:00.340
You're welcome to choose from my shop.

20:02.620 --> 20:03.500
Take your time.

20:03.660 --> 20:04.380
Do come by when you're free.

20:06.700 --> 20:08.780
Sweet and crisp pears.

20:10.660 --> 20:11.380
Miss Chu.

20:12.500 --> 20:13.100
Miss Chu.

20:13.580 --> 20:14.060
Miss Chu.

20:14.300 --> 20:16.020
These pears were freshly picked.

20:16.460 --> 20:17.220
Please, try some.

20:17.700 --> 20:18.140
No, thank you.

20:18.500 --> 20:19.780
You should keep them.

20:20.420 --> 20:21.740
The harvest has been exceptional this year.

20:21.980 --> 20:23.300
Just take them as a share of our good fortune.

20:23.620 --> 20:25.340
When General Chu was still with us,

20:26.020 --> 20:27.260
he always loved our pears.

20:28.420 --> 20:29.140
Please, take it.

20:29.220 --> 20:29.700
I'll take it.

20:30.900 --> 20:31.260
Alright.

20:31.580 --> 20:33.060
Miss Chu, I'll get back to work then.

20:41.980 --> 20:42.860
This gadget

20:43.540 --> 20:44.820
can also be used to catch rats.

20:45.820 --> 20:46.300
Is that so?

20:47.700 --> 20:48.940
Take a look.

20:48.980 --> 20:50.100
Fresh flatbread.

20:50.740 --> 20:51.700
Hot flatbread.

20:51.700 --> 20:52.940
Get your fresh flatbread here.

20:55.220 --> 20:56.500
These flatbreads are meant for sale,

20:56.940 --> 20:58.340
so stop gorging yourself on them.

20:58.900 --> 20:59.540
Are you

21:00.140 --> 21:01.780
some kind of gluttonous beast?

21:02.340 --> 21:03.580
I'm giving you a beating right now.

21:10.620 --> 21:11.100
Stop right there.

21:13.900 --> 21:14.980
Have you been out brawling again?

21:17.260 --> 21:17.740
Did you lose?

21:18.500 --> 21:19.300
I won.

21:19.660 --> 21:21.020
It was three against one,

21:21.100 --> 21:22.620
and I left every single one of them eating dirt.

21:23.460 --> 21:24.660
You're covered in bruises.

21:25.420 --> 21:26.140
What is there to be proud of?

21:26.700 --> 21:27.780
They were calling me

21:27.780 --> 21:28.820
a motherless child.

21:32.340 --> 21:33.020
And so,

21:33.260 --> 21:34.860
you used your fists to shut them up?

21:35.100 --> 21:35.980
Why did I allow you to practice martial arts

21:35.980 --> 21:37.100
in the first place?

21:38.140 --> 21:39.140
To beat people up.

21:40.780 --> 21:42.980
To protect the defenseless.

21:43.420 --> 21:44.180
Your fists

21:44.500 --> 21:45.900
should be aimed at villains,

21:46.340 --> 21:47.180
not at children

21:47.180 --> 21:48.340
your own age,

21:49.140 --> 21:50.100
and certainly never at your own people.

21:55.220 --> 21:55.780
What's on your mind?

21:56.980 --> 21:57.980
I was just thinking

22:00.420 --> 22:01.580
about something my father said.

22:03.220 --> 22:03.780
See?

22:05.420 --> 22:07.100
My father didn't give his life

22:07.620 --> 22:08.300
for

22:08.300 --> 22:09.700
these cold city walls,

22:11.220 --> 22:12.420
but for the laughter

22:13.460 --> 22:14.140
and lives

22:15.060 --> 22:16.620
within them.

22:17.740 --> 22:18.740
Seemingly ordinary,

22:19.340 --> 22:20.940
and insignificant though they be,

22:21.660 --> 22:22.980
yet these things are held dear

22:23.860 --> 22:24.940
above all price in every heart.

22:25.860 --> 22:26.620
I seek no grand vision

22:26.620 --> 22:27.900
of a tranquil realm.

22:28.860 --> 22:30.340
I ask only that the hearth-smoke of Yunzhong Prefecture

22:30.380 --> 22:31.500
rises each day,

22:32.300 --> 22:32.820
and that mothers

22:32.820 --> 22:34.100
may stand at their gates

22:35.140 --> 22:36.180
awaiting their children

22:36.180 --> 22:37.100
to come home for dinner.

22:37.980 --> 22:38.980
The worst thing

22:39.580 --> 22:40.620
these people should have to worry about

22:40.820 --> 22:42.420
is if the price of rice has gone up by a few wen tomorrow.

22:43.820 --> 22:44.540
That is enough.

22:45.820 --> 22:46.660
We drift

22:47.060 --> 22:47.820
through our days,

22:47.820 --> 22:49.420
sunrise to sunset,

22:50.180 --> 22:50.940
unaware

22:51.860 --> 22:52.980
that this life we take for granted

22:53.780 --> 22:54.940
is the very thing others would kneel and pray for,

22:54.940 --> 22:55.980
yet never get.

22:59.660 --> 23:00.980
Maybe in the farmer's eye, the pears

23:03.660 --> 23:05.300
taste sweeter than they did last year,

23:07.300 --> 23:07.860
right?

23:11.180 --> 23:11.780
Jiu.

23:13.700 --> 23:14.900
Please guard Yunzhong Prefecture

23:15.220 --> 23:16.260
in my father's stead.

23:17.060 --> 23:18.420
Become the sharpest blade

23:19.380 --> 23:21.060
in the State of Chu, just as Chu Ling once was.

23:22.620 --> 23:23.180
I will.

23:27.060 --> 23:28.820
Your Highness, there is stirring from the Northern Desert.

23:29.020 --> 23:30.340
An enemy scouting team

23:30.380 --> 23:31.060
is probing our frontier.

23:36.300 --> 23:37.380
What's the situation?

23:37.860 --> 23:39.620
The enemy's vanguard launched a surprise raid on our fortress.

23:39.860 --> 23:41.460
Our left flank has deployed to encircle and eliminate them.

23:42.500 --> 23:43.620
Your Highness, please rest assured.

23:43.740 --> 23:45.060
We can split our forces

23:45.100 --> 23:46.140
and strike the Chi'na Unit's

23:46.180 --> 23:46.980
main army.

23:48.980 --> 23:49.540
Wait.

23:50.220 --> 23:51.420
The scout actually pinpointed

23:51.420 --> 23:53.300
the exact movements of Chi'na Unit's main force.

23:55.900 --> 23:56.860
During the last battle,

23:57.300 --> 23:58.260
the Northern Desert King's main troops

23:58.260 --> 23:59.460
retreated at least eighty li.

24:00.860 --> 24:02.060
Their elite forces

24:02.460 --> 24:03.460
are still stationed

24:03.460 --> 24:04.420
[Yingzui Cliff]
near Yingzui Cliff.

24:05.020 --> 24:05.980
It is physically impossible

24:07.460 --> 24:08.060
for the Chi'na Unit

24:08.060 --> 24:09.460
to appear here within a mere two days.

24:10.540 --> 24:11.660
This surprise raid

24:12.220 --> 24:13.300
is a tactical trap.

24:13.820 --> 24:15.620
Then our left flank is walking into a disaster.

24:15.620 --> 24:16.340
More than just a disaster.

24:17.100 --> 24:18.420
If this truly is an ambush,

24:19.340 --> 24:21.180
our left flank will be entirely wiped out.

24:23.380 --> 24:24.740
We must crush this offensive

24:25.340 --> 24:26.540
before it can even develop.

24:27.220 --> 24:29.540
But our reserves can only hold one front.

24:30.180 --> 24:31.340
If we divert troops to reinforce the flank,

24:31.460 --> 24:32.340
our main defensive line

24:32.940 --> 24:34.260
will be left completely exposed.

24:34.660 --> 24:35.340
Then we'll borrow forces.

24:35.620 --> 24:36.340
From whom?

24:37.140 --> 24:37.860
The Cangmu Stronghold.

24:39.340 --> 24:41.100
Defeating Tie Ying at Cangmu Forest

24:41.260 --> 24:41.860
came down

24:41.860 --> 24:42.820
to their familiarity

24:42.820 --> 24:43.620
with woodland combat,

24:43.900 --> 24:45.060
an advantage our troops could not match.

24:45.660 --> 24:46.540
If we can harness their strength

24:46.700 --> 24:47.740
to coordinate with our forces,

24:48.060 --> 24:48.940
the victory will be ours.

24:50.340 --> 24:52.540
But the Cangmu Stronghold is...

24:52.900 --> 24:53.780
My father has just passed away.

24:54.220 --> 24:55.820
Neither the army's morale nor the people's trust must waver.

24:56.580 --> 24:57.340
Should we fall in this battle,

24:57.860 --> 24:59.140
the Northern Desert will strike with all their might.

25:00.140 --> 25:00.620
Mr. Zhong,

25:00.900 --> 25:01.740
we have no retreat.

25:02.700 --> 25:03.140
Very well.

25:03.380 --> 25:04.420
We will proceed as you suggest.

25:20.420 --> 25:20.900
Rest assured.

25:23.020 --> 25:23.700
I will fight

25:25.060 --> 25:26.340
to my last breath to secure victory.

25:29.620 --> 25:30.700
Xie Yanlai, take your orders.

25:33.660 --> 25:34.260
Yes, Your Highness.

25:35.340 --> 25:35.820
Go...

25:37.780 --> 25:38.420
And stay alive.

25:55.140 --> 25:56.140
This is no military order.

25:58.300 --> 25:59.380
This is my order.

26:05.500 --> 26:06.460
Yes, Your Highness.

26:16.060 --> 26:20.260
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

26:20.780 --> 26:23.220
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

26:23.220 --> 26:26.660
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

26:31.340 --> 26:33.460
♪Through biting winds and frost I go♪

26:33.700 --> 26:36.380
♪I light a lamp, my lone abode♪

26:36.700 --> 26:38.180
♪Half my life adrift♪

26:38.180 --> 26:42.700
♪This lonely shadow finds no haven to moor♪

26:45.060 --> 26:46.860
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

26:46.940 --> 26:48.740
♪And roars in the blaze♪

26:49.020 --> 26:51.260
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

26:51.260 --> 26:52.220
Move out!

26:52.340 --> 26:54.460
♪Fate imprisons me♪

26:54.700 --> 26:58.660
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

26:59.620 --> 27:03.740
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

27:03.820 --> 27:07.700
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

27:08.060 --> 27:13.340
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

27:13.580 --> 27:15.180
♪With no fear of the distance♪

27:15.260 --> 27:19.180
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

27:19.700 --> 27:23.460
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

27:24.260 --> 27:28.620
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

27:29.180 --> 27:32.820
♪My new pride♪

27:36.100 --> 27:38.100
[Xie Residence]

27:38.460 --> 27:39.380
Deng Yi actually had the audacity

27:39.380 --> 27:40.420
to investigate our old estate in Gaoyang.

27:41.220 --> 27:41.740
The news about Xie Yanlai

27:41.740 --> 27:42.820
and the Bloodburn Pill

27:42.820 --> 27:43.900
must have been leaked by him as well.

27:44.780 --> 27:45.860
Deng Yi

27:46.980 --> 27:48.420
is actually targeting my clan.

27:50.100 --> 27:51.260
He is truly ruthless,

27:52.460 --> 27:53.580
bent on

27:53.580 --> 27:55.460
wiping out my entire clan.

27:56.380 --> 27:57.940
Deng Yi is a man of profound calculation.

27:58.740 --> 27:59.820
If not for your benevolence,

27:59.980 --> 28:01.340
how could he have been allowed to live until this day?

28:02.540 --> 28:04.260
He was the Grand Mentor appointed by the late Emperor

28:05.580 --> 28:07.140
and holds the position of Regent,

28:08.420 --> 28:10.140
so he cannot be easily disposed of.

28:10.980 --> 28:11.740
Moreover, he still has

28:11.740 --> 28:12.860
Xiao Xun as a fallback plan.

28:14.140 --> 28:15.340
Since Xiao suffered a setback in Wangcheng,

28:15.900 --> 28:17.580
he will certainly not let the matter rest.

28:20.300 --> 28:20.860
A fallback plan?

28:21.900 --> 28:23.340
He calculated everything in the battle of Wangcheng,

28:23.340 --> 28:24.140
yet his entire plan fell through.

28:25.780 --> 28:27.140
He can barely save himself now.

28:27.580 --> 28:28.500
Although the Northern Desert was defeated,

28:29.260 --> 28:31.340
this war was like a massive earthquake.

28:32.420 --> 28:33.580
The real aftershocks

28:34.220 --> 28:35.380
are just about to begin.

28:36.660 --> 28:38.780
Xiao Xun will definitely bide his time to make a move.

28:41.140 --> 28:41.980
Keep a close eye

28:42.620 --> 28:43.300
on Xiaonan Prefecture.

28:44.940 --> 28:45.460
Yes.

29:15.740 --> 29:16.300
Zhao,

29:17.060 --> 29:19.900
however anxious you are, you must eat something.

29:20.980 --> 29:21.500
Mr. Zhong,

29:22.900 --> 29:23.620
I have no appetite.

29:27.780 --> 29:28.900
Victory!

29:29.580 --> 29:30.620
Victory!

29:31.300 --> 29:31.940
Your Highness,

29:32.140 --> 29:33.020
Assistant General Xie has won!

29:33.060 --> 29:34.100
He routed the enemy's vanguard

29:34.260 --> 29:35.620
and captured their King's son-in-law alive!

29:37.620 --> 29:41.860
- Victory! - Victory!

29:41.980 --> 29:43.900
Our troops' morale is now secure.

29:44.540 --> 29:45.100
General Zhong,

29:45.420 --> 29:46.260
you can rest assured now.

29:46.820 --> 29:47.620
With Her Highness here,

29:47.780 --> 29:49.020
a great victory is all but certain.

29:49.460 --> 29:49.900
Quick!

29:50.220 --> 29:51.980
Report our triumph to the Capital at once!

29:52.580 --> 29:54.220
Let everyone know

29:54.580 --> 29:57.340
that even though Guard General Chu Ling is gone,

29:57.660 --> 29:59.100
the frontier still achieves great victories,

29:59.340 --> 30:00.980
and the state remains secure.

30:01.420 --> 30:01.900
Yes!

30:05.500 --> 30:09.180
- Victory! - Victory!

30:19.180 --> 30:20.060
There is a city ahead.

30:20.420 --> 30:21.940
Go in and announce the victory.

30:22.460 --> 30:24.620
Have the yamen spread the news across the region!

30:30.620 --> 30:32.100
The Northern Desert has returned,

30:32.220 --> 30:33.740
their cavalry has broken through Bailang Pass,

30:33.740 --> 30:35.500
and Yunzhong Prefecture shall fall within three days.

30:35.620 --> 30:37.060
The Northern Desert army marches straight for the Capital!

30:37.180 --> 30:38.540
The Northern Desert army marches straight for the Capital!

30:38.820 --> 30:40.580
The Northern Desert army marches straight for the Capital!

30:45.020 --> 30:45.540
Your Highness,

30:46.220 --> 30:47.220
there is one thing I do not understand.

30:48.820 --> 30:49.380
Speak.

30:50.980 --> 30:52.500
We are already at odds

30:52.500 --> 30:53.300
with the Northern Desert,

30:54.020 --> 30:55.340
so why do you still believe

30:55.940 --> 30:56.860
they will help us?

30:57.380 --> 30:58.540
You are wrong, Tie Ying.

31:00.140 --> 31:01.660
Since the battle of Wangcheng,

31:02.980 --> 31:05.100
I have expected nothing more from them.

31:06.300 --> 31:08.220
To share dominion?

31:09.380 --> 31:11.260
It is nothing but their idle dream.

31:12.100 --> 31:13.100
The war with the Northern Desert

31:13.740 --> 31:14.860
has shaken the land,

31:15.620 --> 31:16.900
and the aftershocks are bound to follow.

31:17.540 --> 31:19.020
With Chu Ling gone,

31:20.060 --> 31:20.820
the Northern Desert King

31:20.820 --> 31:22.620
will seize the moment to invade.

31:23.380 --> 31:24.900
I will use them

31:25.620 --> 31:26.740
to shackle Yunzhong Prefecture.

31:27.460 --> 31:29.780
So what if Chu Zhao wins the battle?

31:30.980 --> 31:31.820
As long as the news

31:32.620 --> 31:33.660
never reaches the Capital,

31:34.700 --> 31:36.300
this victory never happened.

31:36.900 --> 31:37.860
We've killed the dispatch riders

31:38.700 --> 31:39.980
and turned news of victory into news of defeat.

31:42.300 --> 31:44.820
Once the Capital descends into panic,

31:46.060 --> 31:49.140
be it victory or defeat,

31:49.740 --> 31:52.700
I'll have my pretext to march under the banner

31:53.100 --> 31:54.260
of protecting the Capital.

31:54.940 --> 31:55.860
And when that moment comes,

31:57.060 --> 31:58.100
it will be time

31:59.660 --> 32:01.380
for someone else to sit on the throne.

32:03.140 --> 32:03.940
Your Highness is wise.

32:23.580 --> 32:24.740
What task is this

32:24.820 --> 32:25.340
that has distressed

32:25.340 --> 32:26.540
Your Majesty so?

32:27.300 --> 32:29.020
How could any task trouble me?

32:29.540 --> 32:31.060
I am writing a letter to Zhao.

32:32.340 --> 32:33.900
The loss of parents is something

32:34.500 --> 32:35.940
no words can console.

32:36.580 --> 32:37.260
I know.

32:41.820 --> 32:42.500
Your Majesty,

32:42.740 --> 32:43.540
Mr. Xie requests an audience.

32:43.900 --> 32:44.540
It is so late.

32:45.020 --> 32:46.460
Tell Mr. Xie that I have retired for the night.

32:46.580 --> 32:47.180
But Mr. Xie...

32:47.380 --> 32:48.180
I have an urgent matter

32:48.180 --> 32:49.060
to discuss with His Majesty.

32:50.020 --> 32:50.940
You may withdraw.

32:52.020 --> 32:52.660
You're dismissed.

33:05.940 --> 33:06.700
Uncle,

33:07.020 --> 33:08.340
what is it that you wish to tell me?

33:08.820 --> 33:09.620
The dispatch riders reported

33:10.020 --> 33:10.940
that the Northern Desert had returned.

33:11.300 --> 33:13.020
They raided at midnight and our frontier troops fell.

33:13.580 --> 33:14.820
They have routed Yunzhong Prefecture

33:14.980 --> 33:15.980
and are heading straight for the Capital.

33:16.460 --> 33:17.340
Upon hearing the news, the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

33:17.500 --> 33:18.540
assembled fifty thousand troops

33:18.940 --> 33:20.580
and is now eight hundred li away from the Capital.

33:26.580 --> 33:27.220
Yu,

33:28.860 --> 33:29.580
do not be afraid.

33:30.820 --> 33:31.620
The news

33:32.580 --> 33:33.980
may not necessarily be true.

33:34.380 --> 33:35.860
It might just be a ploy to create panic,

33:36.460 --> 33:37.340
making it convenient for the Prince

33:37.460 --> 33:38.540
to lead his troops into the Capital

33:39.020 --> 33:40.380
under the pretext of defending the city.

33:40.940 --> 33:41.420
Are they

33:42.020 --> 33:43.260
planning to rebel?

33:43.820 --> 33:44.540
From the very moment

33:44.540 --> 33:45.940
the Prince left the Capital,

33:46.620 --> 33:47.980
he has always harbored treasonous intent.

33:48.500 --> 33:49.700
This matter is of grave importance,

33:49.900 --> 33:51.460
which is why I came in the dead of night.

33:52.140 --> 33:53.380
We must first agree on how to respond

33:53.900 --> 33:56.900
during tomorrow's court session.

33:59.300 --> 34:00.420
An urgent dispatch has arrived.

34:00.780 --> 34:02.140
The Northern Desert has returned.

34:02.620 --> 34:04.140
Their cavalry has broken through Bailang Pass,

34:04.540 --> 34:06.420
and Yunzhong will fall within three days.

34:06.860 --> 34:08.620
The enemy is pressing toward the Capital.

34:11.620 --> 34:13.100
With Chu Ling dead,

34:13.380 --> 34:14.700
the frontier is indeed...

34:14.780 --> 34:16.740
The Grand Princess is a woman after all,

34:17.660 --> 34:20.100
so how could we truly expect her to defend the frontier?

34:20.900 --> 34:22.620
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

34:22.980 --> 34:24.460
has led fifty thousand troops

34:24.740 --> 34:26.100
to defend the Capital

34:26.580 --> 34:28.300
and is only a few days' journey away.

34:29.940 --> 34:31.260
I petition Your Majesty

34:31.980 --> 34:32.900
to open the city gates

34:33.140 --> 34:35.180
and let them in to defend the Capital

34:35.580 --> 34:37.340
to ensure its peace.

34:38.340 --> 34:41.580
The Prince of Xiaonan commands fifty thousand troops,

34:41.940 --> 34:44.820
the Capital another fifty thousand,

34:45.060 --> 34:47.740
and with forces from other prefectures combined,

34:48.060 --> 34:50.620
we have more than enough to hold

34:50.780 --> 34:52.300
against the Northern Desert troops.

34:52.780 --> 34:53.860
There is

34:54.260 --> 34:56.540
indeed less reason to panic.

34:59.020 --> 34:59.780
Ignorant.

35:00.780 --> 35:01.820
A prince

35:02.020 --> 35:02.980
granted a fiefdom

35:03.580 --> 35:04.820
may collect its taxes and live off its revenues,

35:05.580 --> 35:06.860
but holds no authority over troops.

35:07.620 --> 35:09.500
Even their guard

35:10.100 --> 35:11.580
is capped at a fixed number.

35:12.220 --> 35:13.980
Where did he find fifty thousand troops?

35:14.540 --> 35:15.620
In my view,

35:16.260 --> 35:17.380
the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

35:17.580 --> 35:19.420
uses the defense of the Capital as a pretext

35:19.940 --> 35:21.820
to mask his rebellion.

35:22.300 --> 35:23.660
Mr. Xie, do you imply

35:24.500 --> 35:25.380
that His Majesty should just sit and wait

35:25.380 --> 35:26.820
for the enemy to besiege the Capital?

35:26.940 --> 35:27.860
Fifty thousand troops

35:28.820 --> 35:30.580
are the entire strength of the Capital's garrison.

35:31.100 --> 35:32.140
Allowing these troops

35:32.140 --> 35:33.500
to enter the city?

35:33.980 --> 35:34.780
Do you understand the consequences

35:35.140 --> 35:36.780
if things spin out of control?

35:38.140 --> 35:39.680
The Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture neither offered his condolences

35:39.680 --> 35:40.420
nor paid his respects at court.

35:40.820 --> 35:42.140
His intentions could not be clearer.

35:42.780 --> 35:44.140
Now that Chu Ling is dead,

35:45.100 --> 35:46.740
the threat from the Northern Desert is greater than ever.

35:47.900 --> 35:48.980
I fear the Prince

35:49.420 --> 35:50.780
wants to take advantage

35:50.820 --> 35:52.420
of the chaos.

35:52.940 --> 35:54.700
Just as Mr. Xie said,

35:55.220 --> 35:56.700
the threat from the Northern Desert is so massive

35:57.020 --> 35:58.620
that we cannot afford to gamble at all.

35:59.100 --> 36:00.500
If we are paranoid at this moment,

36:00.740 --> 36:02.140
and the Northern Desert truly breaks through Yunzhong,

36:02.540 --> 36:03.700
the Capital will fall,

36:04.140 --> 36:05.260
the state will no longer be a state,

36:05.860 --> 36:07.820
and we will be condemned for eternity.

36:08.020 --> 36:09.500
Your entire premise

36:10.260 --> 36:11.820
rests on the authenticity of that military report.

36:12.980 --> 36:14.220
However, as I see it,

36:14.820 --> 36:16.020
the credibility of this military report

36:16.380 --> 36:17.700
is still open to question.

36:18.820 --> 36:20.700
You took

36:21.300 --> 36:22.180
the frontier troops' victory reports

36:22.180 --> 36:23.180
at face value

36:23.700 --> 36:25.340
and rewarded Yunzhong Prefecture.

36:26.020 --> 36:26.460
So

36:26.940 --> 36:28.780
dispatch riders bearing good news are trustworthy,

36:29.420 --> 36:31.660
but those bringing ill tidings are suddenly spies?

36:32.460 --> 36:33.540
What should we do then?

36:35.180 --> 36:35.740
Mr. Deng.

36:37.140 --> 36:38.140
I shall issue a decree

36:38.620 --> 36:40.100
ordering the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture's troops

36:40.100 --> 36:40.980
to be divided and stationed

36:41.340 --> 36:43.420
alongside the Capital's garrison to defend the city.

36:44.260 --> 36:45.020
Your Majesty,

36:46.260 --> 36:47.620
this is indeed an effective stalling tactic.

36:48.140 --> 36:49.260
Since the Prince and his heir

36:49.500 --> 36:51.020
use the pretext of defending the Capital,

36:51.340 --> 36:52.580
Your Majesty can let them

36:52.580 --> 36:53.380
do so,

36:53.860 --> 36:55.580
but they must follow the deployments of the imperial court.

36:56.260 --> 36:57.060
If they refuse to comply,

36:57.500 --> 36:58.940
they will be treated as treacherous rebels

36:59.620 --> 37:00.900
whom anyone has the right to execute.

37:01.500 --> 37:02.580
When the state is in turmoil,

37:03.060 --> 37:04.220
trouble will come

37:04.220 --> 37:05.060
from all sides.

37:05.620 --> 37:06.980
The Northern Desert King

37:07.540 --> 37:09.620
and the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture are no different.

37:10.620 --> 37:11.980
I have faced death

37:12.460 --> 37:13.580
and weathered upheaval.

37:14.180 --> 37:14.980
I believe

37:15.660 --> 37:16.980
the State of Chu

37:17.260 --> 37:18.580
will endure.

37:18.940 --> 37:22.140
- We shall give our last breath - We shall give our last breath

37:22.420 --> 37:23.980
- in service - in service

37:24.340 --> 37:25.580
- to Your Majesty - to Your Majesty

37:25.740 --> 37:28.060
- and the State of Chu. - and the State of Chu.

37:38.260 --> 37:39.180
You may withdraw.

37:43.820 --> 37:44.580
Mr. Xie, Mr. Deng,

37:44.900 --> 37:46.140
what is it that you wish to tell me?

37:46.700 --> 37:47.060
Your Majesty.

37:47.060 --> 37:48.900
The Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture leads

37:49.140 --> 37:49.940
not fifty thousand troops

37:50.340 --> 37:51.260
but one hundred thousand.

37:51.940 --> 37:52.940
They are now less

37:53.100 --> 37:53.980
than eight hundred li

37:53.980 --> 37:54.820
from the Capital.

37:56.300 --> 37:57.300
A military march to defend the Capital?

37:58.420 --> 37:59.580
No. This is treason.

37:59.780 --> 38:00.980
Mr. Xie, watch your words.

38:01.700 --> 38:03.460
We do not know if the news is true or false,

38:04.220 --> 38:05.380
so we must not make rash judgments.

38:05.900 --> 38:07.580
Have you notified Zhao?

38:08.540 --> 38:09.540
I fear the news might be blocked

38:09.780 --> 38:10.700
from reaching Her Highness.

38:11.020 --> 38:12.460
You keep claiming

38:12.580 --> 38:14.020
that the Prince of Xiaonan and Xiao Xun are rebelling,

38:14.460 --> 38:16.060
yet you cannot produce any concrete evidence.

38:17.060 --> 38:18.460
With the enemy closing in,

38:19.460 --> 38:21.060
the defense of the Capital is our top priority.

38:21.260 --> 38:22.180
So

38:23.180 --> 38:25.260
you still wish to open the gates

38:25.820 --> 38:27.740
and let the Xiaonan Army in?

38:29.180 --> 38:30.260
I am doing this

38:30.260 --> 38:31.500
for the safety of the Capital.

38:32.300 --> 38:33.980
If the Northern Desert launches an attack,

38:34.620 --> 38:35.940
how are the citizens of the Capital supposed

38:35.940 --> 38:36.900
to protect themselves?

38:40.180 --> 38:41.540
Speculation is useless.

38:42.340 --> 38:44.020
We might as well wait and see

38:45.020 --> 38:46.820
what Xiao Xun decides.

38:53.900 --> 38:54.820
I shall take my leave.

39:04.060 --> 39:05.900
This is the token of the Imperial Guard Commander.

39:06.260 --> 39:07.260
After Uncle Yanlai left the Capital,

39:07.620 --> 39:09.580
the command of the Imperial Guard was handed to his deputy.

39:10.180 --> 39:10.900
The token

39:11.100 --> 39:12.740
has been kept with me.

39:13.740 --> 39:15.140
Since the situation is critical,

39:15.580 --> 39:17.060
I will leave it in your safekeeping.

39:20.900 --> 39:21.460
Very well.

39:22.940 --> 39:23.780
I will ensure

39:24.700 --> 39:26.460
your safety.

39:29.420 --> 39:31.340
His Majesty handed the token of the Imperial Guard Commander over

39:31.340 --> 39:32.540
to Xie Yanfang.

39:33.020 --> 39:33.820
So the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture actually did

39:33.820 --> 39:34.740
him a favor?

39:35.780 --> 39:36.660
It was bound to happen sooner or later.

39:37.380 --> 39:38.900
Even without the Prince,

39:39.340 --> 39:40.980
Mr. Xie would achieve his wish very soon.

39:41.780 --> 39:43.220
His Majesty is helpless.

39:43.900 --> 39:45.460
Why would he ever grow distant

39:45.460 --> 39:46.100
from his uncle?

39:46.940 --> 39:47.860
A child's face and heart

39:48.180 --> 39:49.140
are the most fickle things

39:49.860 --> 39:51.580
in the world.

39:52.700 --> 39:53.820
I warned him.

39:56.660 --> 39:57.460
No matter.

39:58.580 --> 39:59.620
Whoever His Majesty chooses to favor

40:00.060 --> 40:00.940
is no concern

40:01.900 --> 40:02.820
of mine.

40:03.700 --> 40:04.900
Dispatch the edict to the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture

40:04.940 --> 40:06.020
at once.

40:08.540 --> 40:10.180
Select a suitable envoy to deliver it,

40:11.100 --> 40:12.860
and make sure it is done with great fanfare.

40:13.940 --> 40:14.460
Understood.

40:19.420 --> 40:19.940
Mr. Xie,

40:20.460 --> 40:21.100
a scout reports that the vanguard

40:21.500 --> 40:22.980
of the Prince of Xiaonan Prefecture has arrived at Baili Pavilion.

40:29.460 --> 40:31.460
Xiao Xun used fake dispatch riders to spread the news,

40:33.180 --> 40:34.300
executing a real palace coup

40:34.420 --> 40:35.660
under the pretext of defending the Capital.

40:36.780 --> 40:38.420
The public has been taken in by him

40:38.860 --> 40:40.300
and truly believes he came

40:40.660 --> 40:41.500
to protect His Majesty.

40:42.380 --> 40:44.180
They can't wait to throw wide the city gates

40:45.020 --> 40:46.380
and welcome him with open arms.

40:46.660 --> 40:47.500
Deng Yi

40:48.020 --> 40:49.420
has clearly been won over by Xiao Xun

40:49.620 --> 40:50.620
and is willing to do his bidding.

40:52.140 --> 40:53.060
Public opinion is like the wind.

40:54.380 --> 40:55.460
Fight it and you suffer.

40:55.580 --> 40:56.500
Ride it and you prevail.

40:57.980 --> 40:59.660
He can take the Capital

41:00.620 --> 41:01.860
without spilling a drop of blood.

41:02.540 --> 41:03.700
What should we do?

41:04.060 --> 41:05.380
I have informed Yu

41:05.500 --> 41:07.020
about the movements of the Xiaonan Army

41:07.860 --> 41:08.860
and coached him on what to say

41:09.620 --> 41:10.820
and how to draft the imperial edict.

41:11.820 --> 41:13.020
It was all

41:13.020 --> 41:13.940
to fan the flames

41:14.940 --> 41:16.620
and let the coming battle play out

41:17.500 --> 41:19.020
before the world.

41:20.020 --> 41:21.460
The Xie Family

41:23.100 --> 41:24.540
will be the greatest beneficiary

41:25.500 --> 41:26.900
of this confrontation.

41:33.220 --> 41:34.780
Deng Yi had the way cleared with drums.

41:35.380 --> 41:36.580
The imperial envoy is heading toward the Xiaonan Army Camp,

41:36.660 --> 41:37.620
the imperial banner held high.

41:40.820 --> 41:43.260
[Xiaonan Army Camp]

41:43.940 --> 41:45.380
Any who neglect their duty

41:45.540 --> 41:47.660
shall face the full severity of the military law.

41:47.980 --> 41:49.020
But those who stand resolute,

41:49.180 --> 41:50.620
who defend this city with valor,

41:50.820 --> 41:52.100
shall be richly rewarded.

41:52.500 --> 41:54.620
So long as this city stands secure,

41:54.900 --> 41:57.180
the state shall endure.

41:59.460 --> 42:00.020
Your Highness,

42:00.300 --> 42:01.100
please receive the imperial edict.

42:05.780 --> 42:06.340
Your Highness,

42:06.700 --> 42:07.820
this is written

42:07.900 --> 42:09.420
by His Majesty's own hand.

42:11.180 --> 42:12.100
I know.

42:12.620 --> 42:13.100
You...

42:13.540 --> 42:14.180
How insolent!

42:15.900 --> 42:16.540
Xiao Xun,

42:17.140 --> 42:18.140
are you and your father truly going

42:18.220 --> 42:19.860
to defy the imperial command

42:20.140 --> 42:22.020
and commit treason?

42:28.900 --> 42:29.540
Imperial command?

42:32.460 --> 42:33.460
Treason?

42:36.420 --> 42:37.700
The edict states

42:38.540 --> 42:40.300
that fifty thousand troops

42:40.860 --> 42:41.900
stand arrayed outside the city.

42:42.580 --> 42:44.420
Aren't they just waiting for me

42:44.860 --> 42:45.740
to defy the command?

42:46.900 --> 42:49.420
It is the perfect pretext

42:49.820 --> 42:51.340
to have me branded a rebel

42:51.940 --> 42:52.780
and start a war.

42:55.700 --> 42:56.540
When

42:57.460 --> 42:58.380
blades are drawn

42:59.620 --> 43:01.340
and the cavalry cuts through,

43:02.620 --> 43:04.220
the dead will be beyond count

43:04.780 --> 43:06.260
and the land strewn with the starving.

43:07.500 --> 43:08.300
All of it will become

43:08.340 --> 43:09.940
the fault of Xiaonan Prefecture.

43:11.380 --> 43:12.380
And with the false charge

43:13.180 --> 43:14.740
of treason

43:14.860 --> 43:15.780
you have already pinned on me,

43:16.500 --> 43:18.060
the crimes only pile higher.

43:19.380 --> 43:20.460
And I would be guilty

43:20.980 --> 43:23.340
beyond all redemption.

43:29.980 --> 43:30.900
I accept the edict

43:31.940 --> 43:34.900
and will heed His Majesty's command

43:35.380 --> 43:36.180
to protect the Capital.

43:36.700 --> 43:37.460
But sir,

43:38.500 --> 43:39.940
casting an imperial edict into the fire

43:41.020 --> 43:42.740
is an unpardonable offense against His Majesty.

43:46.180 --> 43:47.380
How dare you!

43:47.660 --> 43:48.060
Go.

43:49.020 --> 43:50.420
Make sure he is "taken care of".

43:52.420 --> 43:52.900
Xiao Xun,

43:53.780 --> 43:55.260
you're persecuting a loyal minister!

43:55.420 --> 43:56.740
You will meet a miserable end!

43:56.860 --> 43:57.380
Xiao Xun,

43:57.580 --> 43:59.740
how dare you burn the imperial decree?

44:02.980 --> 44:03.940
Hear my command.

44:05.060 --> 44:05.900
Break camp tomorrow.

44:06.460 --> 44:07.340
Split our forces into four routes

44:08.020 --> 44:09.500
and advance on the Capital!

44:11.060 --> 44:11.820
- Understood! - Understood!

44:11.820 --> 44:13.340
[The Capital]

44:17.700 --> 44:22.300
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

44:22.580 --> 44:25.060
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

44:25.100 --> 44:29.140
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

44:31.380 --> 44:33.500
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

44:33.580 --> 44:35.540
♪And roars in the blaze♪

44:35.620 --> 44:38.860
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

44:39.020 --> 44:41.260
♪Fate imprisons me♪

44:41.420 --> 44:46.220
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

44:46.220 --> 44:50.420
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

44:50.420 --> 44:54.700
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

44:54.700 --> 45:00.140
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

45:00.140 --> 45:02.100
♪With no fear of the distance♪

45:02.100 --> 45:05.820
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

45:05.820 --> 45:10.260
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

45:10.260 --> 45:15.620
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

45:15.620 --> 45:19.220
♪My new pride♪

45:34.020 --> 45:36.900
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

45:36.900 --> 45:39.420
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

45:39.420 --> 45:41.780
♪Amidst the chaos♪

45:41.780 --> 45:46.060
♪I'll always be with you♪

45:47.500 --> 45:49.620
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

45:49.700 --> 45:51.660
♪And roars in the blaze♪

45:51.740 --> 45:54.980
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

45:55.140 --> 45:57.380
♪Fate imprisons me♪

45:57.540 --> 46:02.340
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

46:02.340 --> 46:06.540
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

46:06.540 --> 46:10.820
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

46:10.820 --> 46:16.260
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

46:16.260 --> 46:18.220
♪With no fear of the distance♪

46:18.220 --> 46:21.940
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

46:21.940 --> 46:26.380
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

46:26.380 --> 46:31.740
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

46:31.740 --> 46:35.340
♪My new pride♪
